ub.com/developing-today/code/pull/13019) (merged, `abd8c49dfd77`).\n\nThe §4 escalation tick now live in the aggregator's scheduled watchdog run reads remediation state through an injected seam (`createEscalationTicker`'s `remediationState` reader in `src/escalation-tick.ts`) that currently returns the empty state — because the #9989 executor is a pure module with no production host: nothing runs `decideRemediation`/`recordAttempt` or persists `RemediationState` anywhere in the repo. This issue's §3 verification presupposes remediation actions actually running, i.e. the same host. When a host lands, the escalation tick's reader is the one-line place to point at its persisted state; until then, escalation phases read \"detected\", which is the stack's true condition. No action needed here beyond knowing the seam exists.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/7094120513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/7125311212","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/9990#issuecomment-7125311212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9990","id":7125311212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJWP4788AAAABqLOe7A","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: